WEBVTT

00:07:55.554 --> 00:08:01.685
The first African-American Asian
Vice President was being sworn in.

00:08:01.685 --> 00:08:04.271
This is a moment
that you might not appreciate now.

00:08:04.271 --> 00:08:05.356
(Applause)

00:08:05.356 --> 00:08:06.774
But in time you will.

00:08:07.816 --> 00:08:12.238
And as Kamala Harris was being sworn in,
I said, “Lailaa, now look at her.

00:08:12.238 --> 00:08:13.822
Now you can do that too.”

00:08:14.740 --> 00:08:16.450
And Lailaa looked at me.

00:08:16.450 --> 00:08:20.746
She looked through my eyes, and she said,
“Why couldn’t I before?”

00:08:20.788 --> 00:08:22.248
(Laughter)

00:08:22.289 --> 00:08:27.670
(Applause)

00:08:28.254 --> 00:08:30.256
Suddenly, I felt this big